TEXT 72 -192 Left 2 ;SIM 9 - LNA (rev 2, 5 V)
TEXT 72 -160 Left 2 ;Tests: 50 ohm match and gain ahead of the mixer.
TEXT 72 -128 Left 2 ;Result: S21 15.8 dB, Zin 38 ohm (VSWR 1.31). On the real board expect about 14.1 dB (layout emitter inductance).
